  "body_html": "<h4>Quick Summary</h4><ul><li><p>Silver still looks bullish. </p></li><li><p>Oil still looks bearish. </p></li><li><p>Stock market blow off top is still in effect, despite 2 day pull back.</p></li><li><p>Picking up a stock by end of day, pending no market catastrophes</p></li><li><p>Words mean things. </p></li></ul><h4>Detailed Summary</h4><p>Before diving in on silver, oil and the overall stock market, I want to first emphasize, that “words mean things.” I was a new Navy Officer on my 1st ship in Japan, and I forget what the email was that I had sent. But my Captain was not particularly thrilled about it. He told me: “words mean things.” The point was, what you write, read, type etc. has an impact on how others perceive and react to things. To think about I was typing or saying, before pushing it out for others. </p><p>It was a learning lesson for me, that still applies today. I put thought into everything I say, knowing that you all often react in some form or fashion. When I scroll Substack, or skim the news, I can’t tell you how many times I roll my eyes. 🙄</p><p>This week, the eye rolls are for words like “crashing,” “plunging” and “nose diving”. All of these are extreme bearish connotations for assets. “Rocketing,” “going parabolic” and “to the moon” are examples of the bullish phrases. </p><p>When you, or I, read those words, we get a emotional reaction, that things are either really bad, or really amazing. </p><p>Yet lately, I have been let down when I pull up the TradingView chart…</p><p>For example, with silver:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png\" width=\"511\" height=\"234\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:234,&quot;width&quot;:511,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:23663,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198249594?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KJTs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce35927a-edc9-4f53-843f-38636e89f416_511x234.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">“plunging”</figcaption></figure></div><p>“Silver is plunging…panic selloff”</p><p>or this one: “Silver dives below…”</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png\" width=\"328\" height=\"145\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:145,&quot;width&quot;:328,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:39229,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198249594?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z8lc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ea30d7-2046-4433-85c1-ec9f0b95ecae_328x145.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">“dives”</figcaption></figure></div><p>Posts and articles like these, using words such as “plunging” and “dives” catalyze an emotional reaction out of you. And 9 times out of 10, it will cause you to make a poor decision with your investments. When I hop over to look at the silver chart…a relatively volatile asset on any normal day… the trend is still completely intact. Higher lows forming, price action pointing upward. All of that extreme language…for nothing. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lV5n!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F043fd72d-96b5-4f58-9c6a-05abd4500c0c_1222x819.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lV5n!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F043fd72d-96b5-4f58-9c6a-05abd4500c0c_1222x819.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lV5n!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F043fd72d-96b5-4f58-9c6a-05abd4500c0c_1222x819.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lV5n!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F043fd72d-96b5-4f58-9c6a-05abd4500c0c_1222x819.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lV5n!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F043fd72d-96b5-4f58-9c6a-05abd4500c0c_1222x819.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img sr