\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">caption...</figcaption></figure></div><p>No, I cannot guarantee that silver will NOT crash, or that it will not go down more. But as of right now, there is absolutely ZERO reason to be concerned about silver. If anything, it looks like it is just continuing to carve out a bottom in preparation for another leg upwards. <strong>I remain bullish on silver. </strong></p><p>The exact same story applies to oil, inversely. My honest speculation is that so many retail are trapped in bad oil positions, largely caused by ridiculous estimates and language spewed by influencers and the media. Any green candle (on a smaller timeframe like 4hr), causes extreme <strong>hope</strong>. </p><p>CNBC just released: “Oil jumps…” the buzzword being “jump.”</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png\" width=\"335\" height=\"139\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:139,&quot;width&quot;:335,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:28870,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198249594?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDX5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8b07ff0a-5e1b-4f9f-9c1b-dc1b18b198b5_335x139.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">“jumps”</figcaption></figure></div><p>Then we pull up the oil chart… and I simply do not see what the extreme language is for. If anything, oil is in the exact middle of a range. No jump at all. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png\" width=\"1226\" height=\"816\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:816,&quot;width&quot;:1226,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:190043,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198249594?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PP7x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8797937f-7721-4484-b512-9ab305847af7_1226x816.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">What jump? Looks range bound. </figcaption></figure></div><p>If anything, oil looks pretty bearish on the charts, with high price reactivity to a plethora of high volume sell bars being printed. <strong>I remain bearish on oil. </strong></p><p>Are you seeing why I roll my eyes? Do you see why the extreme language should irritate you? <strong>It wastes our time and causes poor decision making. </strong>You will burn yourself out if you get worked up, or follow content, that gets you emotionally charged every tiny swing up or down. These are simple examples as to why I refuse to read much main stream media anymore, and largely ignore about 99% of creators. </p><h4>The media, and <em>most</em> influencers, care more about you having an emotional reaction, and 👉clicking👈, than they do providing you quality information. </h4><p>Words mean things.</p><p>Don’t get me wrong, I love clicks and views as well. But <em>only if the information you received is actually beneficial to you.</em> That said, if you could like ❤️ and re-stack this (if you have found it useful), I would appreciate it…this is a way we beat out the AI slop here on Substack.</p><h4><strong>Now, onto the overall Stock Market Blow Off Top and a Stock that is making a clean, early breakout. Yes. Blow Off Top. </strong></h4>",
